OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to raise #5m for historic
OL,4,Atheatre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #5m restoration of a
OL,7,Fderelict theatre aim to revive "the
OL,8,Flast historic building" in Somercotes.
OL,10,FSomercotes Parish Council hopes to
OL,11,Fraise the money in order to bring the
OL,12,Fformer Premier Electric Theatre, which
OL,13,Ffirst opened in 1912, back to life.
OL,15,FCampaigners said the restoration would
OL,16,Fprovide opportunities for young people
OL,17,Fin one of Derbyshire's "most deprived
OL,18,Fareas" and has the backing of stars
OL,19,Ffrom stage and screen.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
