OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to raise #5m for historic
OL,4,Atheatre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Somercotes Parish
OL,7,FCouncil chairman, Jason Parker, said:
OL,8,F"You've got a working theatre that's
OL,9,Falso a cinema, does fashion shows, you
OL,10,Fmay get a young person walk past, see
OL,11,Fsomething going on and it sparks their
OL,12,Finterest."
